<urn:atm:triage:finding/RBP-F001-AO23>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RBP-F001-AO23" ;
  triage:title "DoctorExecutionContext.peer_wire_security is untyped Option<String>" ;
  triage:description "atm_core::doctor::report::DoctorExecutionContext.peer_wire_security is a raw Option<String>, hand-matched at consumption sites, reintroducing the anti-pattern already fixed once on the (now-superseded) legacy path via .triage/phase-AI/findings/AI21-IMPORTANT-002.ttl (fixed 2026-07-24 with a PeerWireSecurityStatus enum). This is new code in the AL/AM replacement path, in scope for this sprint. Remediation: replace the raw string field with a typed status (enum or newtype over the existing PeerWireSecurity/mode types) consistent with the AI21 fix pattern." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ao2" ;
